<item>
            <title>[ZEPPELIN-3539] Add jceks stored password support for LDAP</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-3539</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;In LdapRealm there is a property &lt;em&gt;ldapRealm.contextFactory.systemPassword&lt;/em&gt; where the user needs to set system password in cleartext, this provides an alternate mechanism to store the same in jceks.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="13165753">ZEPPELIN-3539</key>
            <summary>Add jceks stored password support for LDAP</summary>
